      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It means the exhausting performance of trying to be something you're not can finally stop. That \"peace\" isn't about them being perfect; it's about *you* being free from the crushing pressure of expectation. You are not a stain; you are a flawed, messy part of a whole that was never truly perfect to begin with. Letting go is just the quiet acknowledgment that you deserve a break from the fight.",
