      "content": "but it's more than just a break from the pressure. it's about the fact that as long as i'm here, i'm actively hurting them. i can see it in how they look at me, how they try to hide the disappointment. if i just... weren't a factor anymore, the damage would stop. wouldn't that be the only truly honorable thing left for me to do? to just remove the problem so they can finally be whole again?",
